    },
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Affliction in light of Eternity"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A prayer of a suffering person who is weak and pours out his lament before the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, hear my prayer;",
          "let my cry for help come before you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do not hide your face from me in my day of trouble.",
          "Listen closely to me;",
          "answer me quickly when I call."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For my days vanish like smoke,",
          "and my bones burn like a furnace."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My heart is suffering, withered like grass;",
          "I even forget to eat my food."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Because of the sound of my groaning,",
          "my flesh sticks to my bones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I am like an eagle owl,",
          "like a little owl among the ruins."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I stay awake;",
          "I am like a solitary bird on a roof."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My enemies taunt me all day long;",
          "they ridicule and use my name as a curse."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I eat ashes like bread",
          "and mingle my drinks with tears"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "because of your indignation and wrath;",
          "for you have picked me up and thrown me aside."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My days are like a lengthening shadow,",
          "and I wither away like grass."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But you, Lord, are enthroned forever;",
          "your fame endures to all generations."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You will rise up and have compassion on Zion,",
          "for it is time to show favor to her —",
          "the appointed time has come."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For your servants take delight in its stones",
          "and favor its dust."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then the nations will fear the name of the Lord,",
          "and all the kings of the earth your glory,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for the Lord will rebuild Zion;",
          "he will appear in his glory."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He will pay attention to the prayer of the destitute",
          "and will not despise their prayer."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "This will be written for a later generation,",
          "and a people who have not yet been created will praise the Lord:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He looked down from his holy heights —",
          "the Lord gazed out from heaven to earth —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "to hear a prisoner’s groaning,",
          "to set free those condemned to die, ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "so that they might declare",
          "the name of the Lord in Zion",
          "and his praise in Jerusalem"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "when peoples and kingdoms are assembled",
          "to serve the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He has broken my strength in midcourse;",
          "he has shortened my days."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I say, “My God, do not take me",
          "in the middle of my life!",
          "Your years continue through all generations."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Long ago you established the earth,",
          "and the heavens are the work of your hands."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They will perish, but you will endure;",
          "all of them will wear out like clothing.",
          "You will change them like a garment,",
          "and they will pass away."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But you are the same,",
          "and your years will never end."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Your servants’ children will dwell securely,",
          "and their offspring will be established before you.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
